[PLACEHOLDER: Compressed backup archive]

This file represents a compressed tar.gz backup of the complete data/ directory
created on 2025-10-20.

To create actual backup:
  tar -czf 2025-10-20_data_snapshot.tar.gz ../queries ../ground_truth ../llm_responses ../results ../proteins ../mass_spectrometry ../structured

Archive contents should include:
- queries/ (all query files)
- ground_truth/ (expert annotations)
- llm_responses/ (model responses in JSONL)
- results/ (analysis results)
- proteins/ (protein databases and FASTA files)
- mass_spectrometry/ (MGF and mzML files)
- structured/ (ontologies and mappings)

Backup metadata:
  Date: 2025-10-20
  Size: ~250 MB (estimated)
  Compression: gzip
  Files: ~70 files
  Purpose: Full data snapshot before final analysis
